# dd on a Today entry deletes the block with its children from the file; z restores it.
file <<END
Home: @due({today})
	- Child task
- Other @due({today})
END
keys gt
see Home:
keys dd
hide Home:
see ▌ - Other
saved <<END
- Other @due({today})
END
keys z
see Home:
quit
saved <<END
Home: @due({today})
	- Child task
- Other @due({today})
END
